WEBVTT

00:00:06.063 --> 00:00:12.063
Choose Analytics in the side menu.

00:00:12.985 --> 00:00:17.957
Click Last 28 days.

00:00:18.207 --> 00:00:24.207
Check that the Views tile shows a number.

00:00:25.974 --> 00:00:31.974
Check that the Finished
watching tile shows a percent.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:40.899
Scroll to Views each day.

00:00:41.149 --> 00:00:46.261
Scroll to Top titles.

00:00:46.511 --> 00:00:51.497
Click Sort by Likes.

00:00:51.747 --> 00:00:56.717
Scroll to Devices.
